  "localChanges": [
    "Remove the dedicated Operative View button, handler, QA export and stale step note.",
    "Reverse the plain-drag azimuth and elevation signs so the visible anatomy follows the pointer horizontally and vertically; preserve Alt/Option roll and pan mappings.",
    "Keep interaction rendering active for the entire held gesture and debounce restoration after final pointer release, avoiding mid-drag canvas resize and synchronous picking on slow frames.",
    "Measure the drag threshold from pointerdown displacement rather than accumulating oscillating hand jitter; never select after a completed drag returns to its start.",
    "Ignore pointer movement until a 5 CSS-pixel drag threshold is crossed to filter press jitter.",
    "Discard pending pick work at drag start and suppress picking-buffer render and synchronous pixel readback during active movement, including pose-animation redraws.",
    "Update accessible gesture instructions, reference documentation and interaction regression checks.",
    "Keep canvas resolution and shader quality steady during pointer motion. Defer picking until release or cancellation.",
    "Apply optional per-step mesh visibility rules consistently to rendering, picking, labels and capture.",
    "Correct reflected winding in the optional Blender export.",
    "Use the fixed native anatomy center in every camera preset and throughout gestures.",
    "Remove the vertical orbit clamp and retain elevation across the poles. Keep Surgeon’s View a standard camera-only preset.",
    "Soften the exterior skin material without moving Pterional meshes.",
    "Use Calibri for the typography changed in the preceding font update.",
    "Restore Pterional PR #1 trackball, view-space pan, lens zoom, touch twist and keyboard controls. Use one immutable anatomy pivot and clear pan on every camera preset.",
    "Clear active gestures on cancellation, lost capture or window blur.",
    "Keep Reset View and Home on the opening overview and use its distance and magnification for directional presets. Keep step close-ups in Recommended View and Focus Change.",
    "Remove unused Pterional helpers and repeated style rules. Use the same native-stream anatomy loader and data reader in the reference and generated guides.",
    "Replace model captures with cited publications in 2D Figures, add expandable cited study notes and approach background, and distinguish skin ink from teaching marks.",
    "Bundle the source figures and use labeled related figures for steps without a direct illustration. Preserve step construction and include figure assets in offline and hosted project builds.",
    "Use one compact Details disclosure, compact citations, and a skin-surface ink mask that persists after marking. Hide the anatomy leader in 2D mode.",
    "List full linked step-specific sources inside Details, alongside citation markers."
  ],
  "geometry": "The current website snapshot retains all six original anatomy chunks and the corrected reflected winding in the optional exporter.",
